      "chunk_ids": [
        "EP4034390A1::desc::p0078"
      ],
      "text": "The conditions under which the 61.996% transfer yield was measured are not specified in EP4034390A1."
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The two chunks report different transfer yield figures for different materials. US12282511B2's Example 2 achieved a transfer yield of 99.994%, while EP4034390A1 cites a literature-reported transfer yield of 61.996% for a comparable material, with the measurement conditions unspecified."
